---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Game catalogue - this will grow as we add games
const games = [
  {
    number: 1,
    slug: 'game-01-sid-symphony',
    name: 'SID Symphony',
    tagline: 'A rhythm game that makes the SID chip sing',
    units: 16,
    unitsAvailable: 16,
    skills: ['Screen layout', 'SID audio', 'Input handling', 'Animation'],
    status: 'complete'
  },
  {
    number: 2,
    slug: 'game-02-sprite-swarm',
    name: 'Sprite Swarm',
    tagline: 'Dodge waves of hardware sprites',
    units: 8,
    unitsAvailable: 0,
    skills: ['VIC-II sprites', 'Collision detection', 'Difficulty curves'],
    status: 'coming-soon'
  },
  {
    number: 3,
    slug: 'game-03-raster-rider',
    name: 'Raster Rider',
    tagline: 'Race the beam with raster interrupts',
    units: 8,
    unitsAvailable: 0,
    skills: ['Raster interrupts', 'Split-screen effects', 'Timing'],
    status: 'coming-soon'
  }
];

const systemColor = '#4a4dff';
---

<Layout
  title="Commodore 64 – Learn Assembly Through Games"
  description="Learn Commodore 64 assembly by building complete games. Master the VIC-II, SID chip, and 6510 CPU through hands-on projects."
>
  <style>
    .system-hero {
      min-height: 350px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a4dff 0%, #7c70da 100%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .system-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background-image:
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          0deg,
          transparent,
          transparent 2px,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 2px,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 4px
        );
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-content {
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .system-title {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .system-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      opacity: 0.95;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }

    .system-specs {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--space-6);
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: var(--space-4);
    }

    .spec-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .spec-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .spec-value {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .content-section {
      padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-4);
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .section-intro {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    /* Game Cards */
    .game-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-6);
    }

    .game-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      gap: var(--space-6);
      padding: var(--space-6);
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--color-text);
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
    }

    .game-card:hover {
      border-color: #4a4dff;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(74, 77, 255, 0.15);
    }

    .game-card.coming-soon {
      opacity: 0.6;
      cursor: default;
    }

    .game-card.coming-soon:hover {
      transform: none;
      box-shadow: none;
      border-color: var(--color-border);
    }

    .game-number {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #4a4dff;
      width: 3rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .game-card.coming-soon .game-number {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .game-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-2);
    }

    .game-name {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .game-tagline {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .game-skills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: var(--space-2);
      margin-top: var(--space-2);
    }

    .skill-tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
      background: rgba(74, 77, 255, 0.1);
      color: #4a4dff;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .game-card.coming-soon .skill-tag {
      background: var(--color-bg);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .game-progress {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: var(--space-2);
      min-width: 100px;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      width: 100px;
      height: 6px;
      background: var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 3px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: #4a4dff;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }

    .progress-text {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    }

    .game-status {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    /* Features */
    .feature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-6);
      margin-top: var(--space-8);
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      padding: var(--space-6);
    }

    .feature-title {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: #4a4dff;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }

    .feature-description {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .game-card {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .game-number {
        width: auto;
      }

      .game-progress {
        align-items: center;
      }

      .game-skills {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .system-specs {
        gap: var(--space-4);
      }
    }
  </style>

  <!-- System Hero -->
  <section class="system-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="system-title">COMMODORE 64</h1>
      <p class="system-subtitle">Learn assembly by building games</p>
      <div class="system-specs">
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">CPU</div>
          <div class="spec-value">MOS 6510</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">Speed</div>
          <div class="spec-value">1 MHz</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">RAM</div>
          <div class="spec-value">64 KB</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">Graphics</div>
          <div class="spec-value">VIC-II</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <div class="spec-label">Sound</div>
          <div class="spec-value">SID</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Getting Started -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Before You Begin</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      You'll need an emulator and an assembler. Both are free and take five minutes to install.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/commodore-64/getting-started"
      style="display: inline-block; padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
             background: var(--color-surface); border: 2px solid #4a4dff;
             color: #4a4dff; border-radius: 0.5rem;
             text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;"
    >
      Set Up Your Tools →
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- Games Catalogue -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Games</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      Each game teaches new skills while building something you'll want to play. Start with Game 1 and work through in order — each builds on what came before.
    </p>

    <div class="game-grid">
      {games.map((game) => (
        <a
          href={game.status !== 'coming-soon' ? `/commodore-64/${game.slug}` : undefined}
          class={`game-card ${game.status === 'coming-soon' ? 'coming-soon' : ''}`}
        >
          <div class="game-number">{game.number}</div>
          <div class="game-info">
            <div class="game-name">{game.name}</div>
            <div class="game-tagline">{game.tagline}</div>
            <div class="game-skills">
              {game.skills.map((skill) => (
                <span class="skill-tag">{skill}</span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="game-progress">
            {game.status === 'coming-soon' ? (
              <span class="game-status">Coming Soon</span>
            ) : (
              <>
                <div class="progress-bar">
                  <div class="progress-fill" style={`width: ${(game.unitsAvailable / game.units) * 100}%`}></div>
                </div>
                <span class="progress-text">{game.unitsAvailable} / {game.units} units</span>
              </>
            )}
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What You'll Master -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">What You'll Master</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      By the time you've built all the games, you'll have deep knowledge of C64 hardware and assembly programming.
    </p>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3 class="feature-title">VIC-II Graphics</h3>
        <p class="feature-description">
          Sprites, character graphics, smooth scrolling, raster interrupts, and the tricks that made C64 games look impossible.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3 class="feature-title">SID Sound</h3>
        <p class="feature-description">
          Three voices, filters, ADSR envelopes, and the techniques that created the C64's legendary sound.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3 class="feature-title">6510 Assembly</h3>
        <p class="feature-description">
          The full instruction set, addressing modes, and optimisation tricks that squeeze every cycle from the CPU.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3 class="feature-title">Game Architecture</h3>
        <p class="feature-description">
          State machines, collision systems, input handling, and the patterns that make games feel right.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Call to Action -->
  <section class="content-section" style="text-align: center;">
    <h2 class="section-title">Ready to Start?</h2>
    <p class="section-intro" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      Game 1 starts with sound and input. By the end of Unit 1, you'll have a screen that looks like a game and a key that makes the SID chip sing.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/commodore-64/game-01-sid-symphony"
      style="display: inline-block; padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
             background: #4a4dff; color: white; border-radius: 0.5rem;
             text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem;"
    >
      Start Game 1: SID Symphony →
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
